      "id": "claim_81ad6ec0aca745ccae1f700496d37dd7",
      "statement": "Per-provider API keys (OPENAI, GEMINI, CURSOR, ANTHROPIC, AI_GATEWAY) follow a three-tier resolution model in lib/api-keys/user-keys.ts: the apiKeys object is seeded from process.env, then overwritten provider-by-provider with values decrypted from the keys table for the signed-in user (using decrypt() from lib/crypto.ts backed by ENCRYPTION_KEY), and the function falls back to the env-initialized object when the DB read throws.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/api-keys/user-keys.ts#L15-L67",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9bd96879e6101e676880746a8f62cdea7c46f43a5100af4665d7b542c50922cf:"
