      "statement": "executeAgentInSandbox in lib/sandbox/agents/index.ts snapshots process.env for all six provider keys plus GH_TOKEN/GITHUB_TOKEN, mutates process.env with the user-supplied keys for the duration of the try block, and unconditionally restores the original values in a finally block so the agent's direct process.env reads cannot leak into a sibling invocation.",
